
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>International Relations</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #eef3f8;
    color: #222;
}

header {
    background: #092c50;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}

nav {
    background: #124d78;
    padding: 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: orange;
}

.hero {
    background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(0,20,50,.65),
    rgba(0,20,50,.65)),
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529107386315-e1a2ed48a620");

    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 120px 20px;
}

.hero h2 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 20px;
}

section {
    padding: 40px 20px;
    max-width: 1150px;
    margin: auto;
}

section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #092c50;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,
    minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #bbb;
}

.card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 210px;
    object-fit: cover;
}

.card-content {
    padding: 20px;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #124d78;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
    line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
    background: #124d78;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 15px;
}

button:hover {
    background: orange;
}

.contact {
    background: white;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

input, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

footer {
    background: #092c50;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS</h1>
    <p>Understanding Global Politics and Diplomacy</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#history">History</a>
    <a href="#organizations">Organizations</a>
    <a href="#diplomacy">Diplomacy</a>
    <a href="#peace">Peace</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>Welcome to International Relations</h2>
    <p>Building Global Understanding, Peace and Cooperation.</p>
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('about').scrollIntoView()">
        Explore More
    </button>
</div>

<section id="about">
    <h2>What is International Relations?</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521295121783-8a321d551ad2"
            alt="World map">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>About International Relations</h3>
                <p>
                International Relations is the study of relationships
                between countries, governments and international
                organizations.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529107386315-e1a2ed48a620"
            alt="International flags">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Global Cooperation</h3>
                <p>
                Countries cooperate to promote development,
                security, trade and international understanding.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="history">
    <h2>History of International Relations</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569025690938-a00729c9e1f9"
            alt="Historic building">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Historical Development</h3>
                <p>
                International Relations developed as an academic
                discipline after the First World War.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528605248644-14dd04022da1"
            alt="International meeting">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>International Meetings</h3>
                <p>
                International meetings help countries discuss
                challenges and find common solutions.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="organizations">
    <h2>International Organizations</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529107386315-e1a2ed48a620"
            alt="United Nations">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>United Nations (UN)</h3>
                <p>
                Promotes international peace, security,
                human rights and cooperation.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba"
            alt="African landscape">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>African Union (AU)</h3>
                <p>
                Promotes unity, integration and cooperation
                among African countries.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494412519320-aa613dfb7738"
            alt="International trade">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>World Trade Organization</h3>
                <p>
                Provides a framework for international
                trade rules and negotiations.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="diplomacy">
    <h2>Diplomacy and Foreign Policy</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902"
            alt="People working together">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Diplomacy</h3>
                <p>
                Diplomacy involves communication and negotiation
                between countries to maintain peaceful relationships.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac"
            alt="People cooperating">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Foreign Policy</h3>
                <p>
                Foreign policy describes how a country
                manages its relationships with other nations.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="peace">
    <h2>Global Peace and Security</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475721027785-f74eccf877e2"
            alt="International conference">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Peace and Security</h3>
                <p>
                International cooperation helps address
                conflicts, insecurity and global challenges.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img loading="lazy"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511632765486-a01980e01a18"
            alt="Community cooperation">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Human Rights</h3>
                <p>
                Human rights promote dignity, equality,
                freedom and justice for all people.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <div class="contact">
        <form onsubmit="sendMessage(event)">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
            <textarea placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <h3>International Relations Educational Website</h3>
    <p>Learning about Global Politics and Diplomacy</p>
    <p>© 2026 All Rights Reserved</p>
</footer>

<script>
function sendMessage(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
    alert("Thank you for contacting us!");
    event.target.reset();
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
